Revision history for WFC

2.2.0  2026-10-15
- Update to WebForms Core version 2.2.
- Compatible with WebFormsJS 2.2.
- Rename the `set_reflection` method to `set_reflect`.
- Rename the `set_reflection_by_output_place` method to `set_reflect_by_output_place`.
- Rename the `wf_break` method to `break_`.
- Rename the `wf_else` method to `else_`.
- Rename the `then_form` method to `then`.
- Rename the `repeat_form` method to `repeat`.

2.1.1  2026-09-14
- Initial CPAN release.
- Initial Perl implementation of WebForms Core.
- Compatible with WebFormsJS 2.1.